# Testing

- Use xUnit, FluentAssertions, and NSubstitute.
- Test one behavior per fact. Name tests as `{Method}_{Condition}_{ExpectedResult}`.
- Mock ports and validators at the boundary. Do not mock the type under test.
- Prefer pure unit tests. Use the database only for persistence tests.
- Assert the outcome, not the private implementation.
- Run `dotnet test backend/LifeFitAI.sln` before a commit that changes the backend.

```csharp
validator.ValidateAsync(Arg.Any<ValidationContext<SampleCommand>>(), Arg.Any<CancellationToken>())
    .Returns(new ValidationResult([failure]));

await act.Should().ThrowAsync<ValidationException>();
